Wolfenstein 3-D for Windows: what's in this package\par\par
No game data is included: you need the data files of your own copy of Wolfenstein 3-D or Spear of Destiny (or the shareware episode).\par\par
The program: id Software's Wolfenstein 3-D source (1995), under id Software's Limited Use Software License Agreement (LICENCE.DOC in the source), with this port's changes: https://github.com/jasonbrianhall/wolf3d\par\par
The AdLib and the General MIDI synth are DOSBox's OPL emulator (dbopl), GPL 2 or later. SDL2 is under the zlib license. The General MIDI instruments are zenamp's (MIT license).\par\par
MUSIC: the game's songs as General MIDI files, from wolfmidi by ericvids (GPL 2): https://github.com/ericvids/wolfmidi\par\par
RESPAWN.WAD: one sound from Freedoom (BSD license, FREEDOOM.TXT).\par\par
This package is provided as is, without warranty of any kind.\par}
